msgstr "年行模拟"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: tooltip
#: scenes/ui/climelapse_export_dialog.gd:206
msgid ""
"The game's analemma (the timeline's ∞): the clock jumps a day at a time, the sun (or the moon) is caught at the same moment each day, and the figure-eight it traces is drawn on the sky as the video plays. A range shorter than a month becomes a year; the speed is days per second of video."
msgstr ""
"游戏中的年行模拟（时间轴的∞）：时钟按天跳动，太阳（或月亮）在每天的同一时刻被捕捉，形成的八字形轨迹在视频播放时绘制在天空中。少于一个月的范围会变成一年；速度以天/秒为单位。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/climelapse_export_dialog.gd:208 scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1739
