#. budget: tooltip
#: scenes/ui/climelapse_export_dialog.gd:210
msgid ""
"A clear sky hides the cloud layers and their shadows for the video only. The weather data and the energy figures do not change."
msgstr "晴空会隐藏云层及其阴影，仅对视频有效。天气数据和能耗数据不会改变。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/climelapse_export_dialog.gd:211
