"One motor per axis. The bed carries Y (it moves the opposite way to the commanded Y, so the tool ends up over the point), the X beam climbs the Z screws, the X carriage slides along it."
msgstr "每轴一个电机。床面承载Y（它与命令的Y反向移动，所以工具最终位于该点上方），X梁沿Z螺杆爬升，X载具沿着它滑动。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/gantrylab_modal.gd:1475
msgid ""
"One motor per axis, two on Y for a wide gantry: the whole gantry rides the Y rails, the X carriage rides the gantry beam, the Z axis plunges the tool. Screws, not belts, because a cutter pushes back."
msgstr ""
"每轴一个电机，Y轴上两个用于宽型龙门架：整个龙门架沿着Y导轨移动，X载具沿着龙门架梁移动，Z轴下降工具。使用螺杆而不是皮带，因为切割器会反推。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/gantrylab_modal.gd:1477
msgid ""
"One motor per axis. The head moves in X along the beam and in Y with the beam on the top rails; only the bed moves in Z, dropping a layer at a time."
msgstr "每轴一个电机。喷头沿梁在X方向移动，并在顶部导轨上与梁一起在Y方向移动；只有床面在Z方向移动，一次下降一层。"

