# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1521
msgid "Show run lengths on 3D wires"
msgstr "在三维线路上显示运行长度"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1531
msgid ""
"3D wires are off by default (timeline chip: “3D wires”). Flow glow adds a marching pulse; leave off for a quieter look. Aim a wire → Interact for style, drag to pin a route."
msgstr ""
"三维线路默认关闭（时间轴芯片：“三维线路”）。流程发光增加一个行进脉冲；关闭以获得更安静的观感。瞄准线路 → 互动以设置样式，拖动以固定路径。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1538
