#. budget: tooltip
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:1993
msgid ""
"Bounced-light global illumination for interiors, shade structures and camps. Calibrated to DaylightModel with wider outdoor cascades and a smooth fade at survey-drone altitudes."
msgstr "用于室内、遮阳结构和营地的多次反弹光全局照明。已根据具有更广阔室外级联和在测绘无人机高度平滑衰减的日光模型进行校准。"

