msgstr "渲染分辨率 %"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:2923
msgid ""
"Renders the 3D world below native resolution and upscales it — the biggest lever for GPU-limited (low-FPS) scenes. UI stays crisp. 100% = native."
msgstr "在低于原生分辨率下渲染 3D 世界并进行放大——对于受 GPU 限制（低帧率）的场景最大的调节器。UI 保持清晰。100% = 原生。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:2929
msgid "Prop draw distance"
msgstr "道具绘制距离"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:2930
msgid "Placed props cast shadows"
msgstr "放置的道具投射阴影"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:2934
msgid "Shadow detail"
msgstr "阴影细节"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: button
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:2939
msgid "Full (every part)"
msgstr "全部（所有部分）"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: button
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:2941
msgid "Medium (drop fine detail)"
msgstr "中（舍弃精细细节）"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
# qa: 5 Low (main structure only)
#. budget: button
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:2942
msgid "Low (main structure only)"
msgstr "低（仅主结构）"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:2947
msgid "Show performance overlay (F3)"
msgstr "显示性能覆盖层 (F3)"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:2962
msgid ""
"Small props fade out past the draw distance to save GPU; large landmarks (StarShade, domes, racks) stay visible. Turning off prop shadows helps on sites with thousands of props. F3 opens the live frame-cost overlay."
msgstr ""
"小道具在超出绘制距离后会淡出以节省 GPU；大型地标（StarShade、穹顶、货架）保持可见。关闭道具阴影有助于处理拥有数千个道具的场地。F3 打开实时帧成本覆盖层。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3153
msgid ""
"Frame time is over 22 ms and MSAA is above this graphics preset. 8× was about 12 ms on a dense forest. Preset's is the cheaper setting."
msgstr "帧时间超过 22 ms，且 MSAA 高于此图形预设。在茂密森林中 8× 大约是 12 ms。预设是更经济的设置。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3590
msgid "Key bindings"
msgstr "按键绑定"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3591
msgid ""
"Click a key to change it, then press the new key (or a mouse side button; Esc cancels). Keys are remembered by position, so they stay put on any keyboard layout. ↺ puts a key back to the default. The F1 help, the on-screen prompts and the tour show whatever you choose."
msgstr ""
"点击一个键进行更改，然后按下新键（或鼠标侧键；Esc 取消）。按键按位置记忆，因此在任何键盘布局上都会保持原位。↺ 将按键恢复到默认。F1 帮助、屏幕提示和导览将显示您选择的内容。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3601
msgid "Reset all to defaults"
msgstr "重置为默认值"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3606
msgid "Every key is back to its default."
msgstr "所有按键均恢复到默认值。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3649 scenes/ui/scada/tag_browser.gd:122
msgid "Other"
msgstr "其他"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3672
msgid "Back to the default key"
msgstr "恢复默认按键"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3688
msgid "Press a key…"
msgstr "请按键…"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3707
msgid "Press the new key for “{action}” — Esc cancels."
msgstr "按新键执行 “{action}” — Esc 取消。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3714
msgid "{action} is back to {key}."
msgstr "{action} 已恢复到 {key}。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3726
msgid "That key cannot be bound."
msgstr "该按键无法绑定。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
# qa: 5 {action} is now {key}.
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3729
msgid "{action} is now {key}."
msgstr "{action} 现在是 {key}。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3736
msgid "{key} also fires: {actions}. Both will respond to that key."
msgstr "{key} 也触发: {actions}。两者都会响应该键。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3756
msgid "Unchanged."
msgstr "未更改。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3785
msgid "First person"
msgstr "第一人称"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3785
msgid "Third person (follow)"
msgstr "第三人称（跟随）"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3789
msgid ""
"F5 switches between them in play. Third person is a follow camera: the mouse orbits it, you walk the way it faces and your body turns to follow; on a vehicle it chases behind."
msgstr "F5 在游戏中在两者间切换。第三人称是跟随摄像机：鼠标围绕它旋转，您朝它面向方向行走，身体会跟随转动；在载具上则在后方追随。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3790
msgid "Field of view°"
msgstr "视场角°"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3791
msgid ""
"Horizontal field of view on foot, in both views. Wider = more peripheral view (and more lens distortion). Drone FOV is under the Drone tab."
msgstr "步行时的水平视场角，两种视图均适用。越广 = 周边视野越广（且透视畸变更明显）。无人机 FOV 在“无人机”选项卡下。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3792
msgid "Follow distance"
msgstr "跟随距离"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3795
msgid "Centred"
msgstr "居中"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3795
msgid "Left"
msgstr "左"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3795
msgid "Right"
msgstr "右"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3795
msgid "Shoulder"
msgstr "肩部"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3798
msgid "Swing the camera back behind a vehicle while driving"
msgstr "驾驶时将摄像机甩到车辆后方"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
# qa: 3 Role
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3803
msgid "Character"
msgstr "角色"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3809 scenes/ui/vehiclelab_modal.gd:537
msgid "Body"
msgstr "身体"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3815
msgid "Rescan"
msgstr "重新扫描"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: tooltip
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3816
msgid "Look for new character files"
msgstr "查找新的角色文件"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3836
msgid "Outline colour"
msgstr "轮廓颜色"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3839
msgid "Open characters folder…"
msgstr "打开角色文件夹…"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3844
msgid ""
"The default body is a detailed version of the NPCs' stick figure. To play as another character, drop a .glb, .gltf or .fbx into the characters folder and press Rescan. Its own clips are used when they are named idle / walk / run; a Mixamo-rigged character without them borrows Remy's idle, walk and jog (needs the Player Character pack). Remy appears in the list when that pack is installed."
msgstr ""
"默认模型是 NPC 的精细版骨架。如需使用其他角色，请将 .glb、.gltf 或 .fbx 文件拖放到角色文件夹中并按下重新扫描。其自带的动作片段用于命名为 idle / walk / run 的动作；没有这些片段的 Mixamo 骨架角色将借用 Remy 的 idle、walk 和 jog（需要玩家角色包）。当安装了该包后，Remy 会出现在列表中。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3853
msgid "Crowd detail (look vs performance)"
msgstr "人群细节（外观 vs 性能）"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3854
msgid "Full-detail figures"
msgstr "全细节人物"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3858
msgid "Simulated in full"
msgstr "完全模拟"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
# qa: 3 Crowd Character Coverage
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3862
msgid "Crowd figure reach"
msgstr "人群人物覆盖范围"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3866
msgid ""
"Lighter at high speed (fewer full figures and full simulation above 300×)"
msgstr "高速下更轻（300× 以上减少全人物和完全模拟）"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: tooltip
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3869
msgid ""
"At 300× and faster a full figure is a blur: shrink both budgets (to about 60 % at 300×, 30 % at 1000×) to keep the frame rate up."
msgstr "在 300× 及以上倍率下，全人物会模糊：请缩小两个预算（在 300× 时约为 60%，在 1000× 时约为 30%）以保持帧率。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3885
msgid "Now: no people simulated on this map."
msgstr "当前：此地图上未模拟人群。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3891
msgid ""
"Now: {heroes} (budget {budget}) · {over} · {crowd} light crowd{light_crowd} · {frames_per_second} fps"
msgstr ""
"当前：{heroes} (预算 {budget}) · {over} · {crowd} 稀疏人群{light_crowd} · {frames_per_second} fps"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3901
msgid ""
"Turn a number up and watch the frame rate here (or F3). The full simulation and the full figures cost CPU; the crowd figures and their reach cost GPU. 0 / far left = Auto."
msgstr "调高一个数值，观察此处的帧率（或按 F3）。完全模拟和全人物消耗 CPU；人群人物及其覆盖范围消耗 GPU。0 / 最左侧 = 自动。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3952
msgid "Population"
msgstr "人口"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3953
msgid "Simulate & draw NPCs"
msgstr "模拟与绘制 NPC"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: tooltip
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3956
msgid ""
"Off: every person is frozen and hidden, with no simulation or rendering cost. Habitats bill their authored headcount at the classic constant rate, so the graph's water/food/waste numbers still mean something. Switch back on and the community resumes where it was left (a long gap is caught up the usual way). Festival mode switches it back on."
msgstr ""
"关闭：每人都处于冻结和隐藏状态，无模拟或渲染成本。栖息地按其设定的固定速率计费人口数，因此图表中的水/食物/废物数据仍然有意义。重新开启后，社区将从上次中断的地方恢复（长时间间隔会按常规方式补齐）。节日模式会重新开启它。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3957
msgid ""
"Turn off for site analysis — no NPC logic, figures, crowd, chips or alarms. The people are paused, not deleted."
msgstr "关闭以进行现场分析——无 NPC 逻辑、人物、人群、芯片或警报。人员处于暂停状态，而非删除。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3961
msgid "Animation editor…"
msgstr "动画编辑器…"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: tooltip
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3962
msgid ""
"Pose and keyframe the stick figure with a tool in its hands — sawing, drilling, fastening, carrying — and save the clips the build crews play."
msgstr "使用工具为骨架人物摆姿势和设置关键帧——锯木、钻孔、固定、携带——并保存建筑工人的动作片段。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3969
msgid "Body style"
msgstr "身体风格"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: button
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3978
msgid "Humanoid (rigged)"
msgstr "类人（骨架）"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: button
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3979
msgid "Simplified (stylised)"
msgstr "简化（风格化）"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3987
msgid ""
"Simplified draws articulated stick figures with elbows and knees. Behaviour is identical — only the look changes. Takes effect as people come back into view."
msgstr "简化版绘制带有肘部和膝盖的关节骨架。行为相同——仅外观改变。当人员重新进入视野时生效。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:3998
msgid "Mo-cap spice"
msgstr "动作捕捉增强"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: tooltip
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4008
msgid ""
"Simplified style: how often a nearby stick figure breaks into a real motion-captured clip (FUCK YES, a cheer, a dance break, a story, a stretch…) before easing back. 0 = never (procedural only), middle = as designed, right = twice as often. Clips live in Imported Models/NPC/mocap/<moment>/ (see docs/ASSETS.md); a moment with none stays procedural."
msgstr ""
"简化风格：附近骨架人物偶尔会爆发成真实的动作捕捉片段（太棒了，欢呼、跳舞、故事、伸展……）后再平稳恢复。0 = 从不（仅程序化），中间 = 按设计，右 = 频率翻倍。片段存储在 Imported Models/NPC/mocap/<moment>/（参见 docs/ASSETS.md）；没有片段的时刻保持程序化。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4021
msgid ""
"The humanoid character pack is not installed (see docs/ASSETS.md) — simplified is in use regardless."
msgstr "未安装类人角色包（参见 docs/ASSETS.md）——无论如何都使用简化版。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4028
msgid "Dance to the beat"
msgstr "随着节拍起舞"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
# qa: 3 People dancing near the performance stage move with the beat, raising their hands when the bass builds and jumping when the bass drops; the DJ raises one arm during the warm-up phase. The stage's own track (its music) is analyzed in real-time; performances without a track will generate a virtual track with a typical beat. LED lights in the lighting studio (J) have their own "sound response" switch.
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4031
msgid ""
"People dancing near a playing stage move on its beat, put their hands up as a drop builds and jump when it lands; the DJ holds an arm up through the run-up. A stage's own track (its Music) is analysed live; a set with no track gets a made-up one at a typical tempo. LED lights have their own \"Sound reactive\" switch in the Light Studio (J)."
msgstr ""
"在表演舞台附近跳舞的人会随着节拍移动，在低音构建时举起双手并在低音落下时跳跃；DJ 在预热阶段会举起一只手臂。舞台自身的曲目（其音乐）会实时分析；没有曲目的演出会生成一个典型节拍的虚拟曲目。LED 灯在灯光工作室（J）有自己的“声音响应”开关。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4038
msgid "Alex, Sam, River, …"
msgstr "亚历克斯、山姆、里弗，…"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4044
msgid "Add to the name list"
msgstr "添加到姓名列表"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4053
msgid "using the built-in names"
msgstr "使用内置名称"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4053
msgid "{n} of your names in the list"
msgid_plural "{n} of your names in the list"
msgstr[0] "列表中的 {n} 个名字"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4071
msgid "Show NPC tint colors"
msgstr "显示 NPC 色彩"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4075
msgid ""
"Each person gets a distinct pastel outline by default. Turn off to render everyone in plain black — no individual colors."
msgstr "默认情况下，每个人都有独特的柔和轮廓。关闭后，所有人渲染为纯黑色——无个体颜色。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4085
msgid "Overhead status"
msgstr "过顶状态"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: button
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4090
msgid "Always (nearby)"
msgstr "始终（附近）"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: button
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4091
msgid "Only when aimed at"
msgstr "仅瞄准时"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4101
msgid ""
"The task tag (and, if enabled below, the morale bar) above each head. 'Always' shows them for people within ~30 m; 'Off' keeps clean silhouettes (aiming still names people)."
msgstr "每个头部上方的任务标签（以及下方是否启用的情绪条）。“始终”显示距离约 30 m 内的人；“关闭”保持干净的轮廓（瞄准时仍显示姓名）。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4107
msgid "Show mood bars over heads"
msgstr "显示头部情绪条"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4110
msgid "Peak Experience toasts (FUCK YES!!!)"
msgstr "巅峰体验提示（太棒了！！！）"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4113
msgid "Beacon over each FUCK YES!!! (where it happened)"
msgstr "每个太棒了！！！（发生地点）上的信标"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4116
msgid "Fun Meter (the crowd's overall vibe, a needle gauge)"
msgstr "乐趣值（人群的整体氛围，一个指针表）"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4124
msgid "FUCK YES contagion"
msgstr "太棒了！！！传染"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: tooltip
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4134
msgid ""
"How strongly one person at FUCK YES!!! raises the odds of the people round them. 0 = no spread (every peak is its own spark), 1 = as designed, 4 = wildfire."
msgstr "一个人在太棒了！！！时能提高周围人群几率的强度。0 = 无传播（每次高峰都是独立的火花），1 = 按设计，4 = 野火。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4150
msgid "Stage music volume"
msgstr "舞台音乐音量"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: tooltip
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4160
msgid ""
"Volume of the tracks venues play during their sets (set a venue's track in its Ctrl-focus row → Music). 0 = off."
msgstr "每个场地在演出期间播放的曲目音量（在场地的 Ctrl-焦点行 → 音乐中设置场地的曲目）。0 = 关闭。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4169
msgid "Ambient sound volume"
msgstr "环境音量"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: tooltip
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4179
msgid ""
"The first-person sound bed: wind with the weather's wind speed, rain with the rain rate, the nearest stream's rush, birdsong by daylight in the forest. Silent while the clock is paused and away from first person. Drop your own wind / rain / stream / birds .mp3, .ogg or .wav into user://ambient/ to replace the built-in sounds. 0 = off."
msgstr ""
"第一人称音景：风与天气风速、雨与降雨量、最近溪流的潺潺声、森林中的鸟鸣。当时钟暂停且远离第一人称时保持静音。将您自己的 wind / rain / stream / birds .mp3、.ogg 或 .wav 放入 user://ambient/ 以替换内置声音。0 = 关闭。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4184
msgid ""
"People glow with how good a time they are having; a crowd that is vibing with its needs met builds a CHARGE toward FUCK YES!!! — a green shimmer that grows and quickens on the body, faster with peakers nearby (the meter over their head shows it, with ↑ while someone is feeding it) — then tips into a green, pulsing glow and the samba. Every one scores a Peak Experience. Each person's state (FUCK THIS!!! … Fuck It!) shows over their head; the bars are off by default."
msgstr ""
"人们会根据过得好不好而发光；一个需求得到满足、充满活力的群体会朝着太棒了！！！积聚“能量”——一种在身体上生长的、加速的绿色微光，附近有高峰时更快（头上的仪表会显示，有人为其供能时有 ↑）——然后转变为绿色脉冲光芒和桑巴舞。每个人都会获得一次巅峰体验。每个人的状态（太糟了！！！……可算！）会显示在他们头上；默认情况下，这些条是关闭的。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4195
msgid "Draw people"
msgstr "绘制人物"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
