msgid "Home camp only"
msgstr "仅限家庭营地"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: button
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4201
msgid "All camps"
msgstr "所有营地"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: button
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4202
msgid "Within a distance"
msgstr "在距离内"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: button
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4203
msgid "Nobody"
msgstr "无"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: tooltip
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4215
msgid "Reach of 'Within a distance'"
msgstr "“在距离内”的范围"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4220
msgid "Distant crowd as dots (the light crowd past the figure reach)"
msgstr "远处的点状人群（光流到达人物后）"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: tooltip
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4223
msgid ""
"The far field of the festival crowd, drawn as dots out to 3 km. Off: no dots — the light crowd is drawn only as figures near you and dissolves out toward the edge of the Crowd figure reach. Nobody near you ever pops in or out either way."
msgstr ""
"节日人群的远景，以点状形式绘制至 3 km。关闭时：无点状显示——光流仅绘制您附近的个体，并向人群范围边缘消散。您附近的任何人都不会突然出现或消失。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4226
msgid ""
"At festival scale the camp you are in keeps full bodies; every other camp is a light crowd drawn as figures up close and dots far away. 'Home camp only' draws just your camp; 'Nobody' hides everyone (the simulation and the Site Plan keep running)."
msgstr ""
"在节日规模下，您所在的营地保留完整人物；其他营地则以近处人物和远方点状形式显示。‘仅限本营’仅绘制您所在的营地；‘无人群’隐藏所有人（模拟和场地规划继续运行）。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
# qa: 4 Test and configuration
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4234
msgid "Testing & provisioning"
msgstr "测试与配置"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4236
msgid ""
"Guardrails off, for trying things out. 'Ideal supply' meets every need as if the infrastructure were perfect and reports what it would have to deliver (the optimal demand); the others stop queues, departures and the alarm feed."
msgstr ""
"护栏关闭，用于尝试新功能。‘理想供应’满足所有需求，如同基础设施完美无缺，并报告其必须提供的量（最优需求）；其他选项则停止队列、离开和警报信息流。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4242
msgid "Ideal supply — every need met, shortfalls counted as imports"
msgstr "理想供应——满足所有需求，短缺计为进口"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4250
msgid "Ignore space capacity (no queues)"
msgstr "忽略空间容量（无队列）"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4254
msgid "Nobody leaves, perishes or collapses the colony"
msgstr "无人员离开、消亡或使定居点崩溃"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4258
msgid "Mute the settlement feed, alarms and toasts"
msgstr "静音定居点信息流、警报和提示"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4265
msgid "New camps stocked for"
msgstr "新营地库存"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: tooltip
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4273
msgid ""
"How many days of water, food and firewood a camp stamped from a placement lot starts with (also the inspector's default)"
msgstr "一个从放置地块开始的营地初始拥有多少天的水、食物和柴火（也是检查员的默认值）"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4285
msgid "Festival population"
msgstr "节日人口"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: tooltip
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4294
msgid ""
"Total people across every festival camp, split by each camp's painted size. 0 = each camp's own headcount (from its area, or the number you typed). Applies live; rosters grow and shrink in place."
msgstr "所有节日营地的总人数，按每个营地的绘制大小划分。0 = 每个营地的独立人数（来自其区域或您输入的数字）。实时生效；人员名单会原地增减。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:4310
msgid "Routines"
msgstr "日常活动"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
