# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:854
msgid "Simulate extreme weather events"
msgstr "模拟极端天气事件"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:855
msgid "Warn me when a hazard begins"
msgstr "当危险开始时提醒我"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:856
msgid "Drama"
msgstr "戏剧性"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:859
msgid ""
"Hazards are triggered from real data for this site — air-quality readings, the weather archive, and National Weather Service alert history. Drama scales only how severe a hazard LOOKS; it never changes the physics behind solar output or health. Turning a hazard off removes it from the simulation entirely."
msgstr ""
"危险警报基于该地点的真实数据触发——空气质量读数、天气档案和国家气象局警报历史。戏剧性仅衡量危险看起来有多严重；它绝不会改变太阳能输出或健康背后的物理原理。关闭危险警报会将其从模拟中完全移除。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:867
msgid "Your site's risk profile"
msgstr "站点风险概况"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:878
msgid "Refresh risk profile"
msgstr "刷新风险概况"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:889
msgid "Not simulated yet — tracked for the risk profile only"
msgstr "尚未模拟 — 仅跟踪风险概况"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
# qa: 4 Dust
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:900
msgid "Wind-blown dust"
msgstr "风尘"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:902
msgid ""
"Dry ground starts to blow once the wind passes the speed below, unless it rained within the dry spell. Light haze just past it, a real dust storm around 30 mph and a wall from about 45 mph. Needs the Dust Storm hazard ticked above and the simulation switched on."
msgstr ""
"干燥地面在风速低于以下值时开始扬尘，除非干旱期间下过雨。轻微的薄雾刚过，真正的沙尘暴在约 30 mph，约 45 mph 时形成屏障。需要勾选上方的沙尘暴危害，并开启模拟。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:908
msgid "Wind (mph)"
msgstr "风速 (mph)"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:910
msgid "Dry spell (h)"
msgstr "干旱期 (h)"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:912
msgid "Wet climates raise less dust"
msgstr "湿润的气候扬尘较少"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: tooltip
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:913
msgid ""
"Scales the dust by the site's yearly rainfall: full on desert ground (under 250 mm a year), a fifth on a wet, green site (1000 mm and more)."
msgstr "根据站点的年降雨量计算扬尘程度：沙漠地带（年降雨量低于 250 mm）为满值，湿润的绿色站点（年降雨量 1000 mm 及以上）为五分之一。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:922
msgid "Dust look"
msgstr "尘埃外观"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
# qa: 5 Visual effect of dust storm. These do not change any content, only change the picture: visibility, solar power output and health status still follow real dust. Preview the dust storm below to see your changes.
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:924
msgid ""
"How a dust storm looks. These change nothing but the picture: visibility, solar output and health still follow the real dust. Preview a Dust Storm below to see your changes."
msgstr "沙尘暴的视觉效果。这些不改变任何内容，仅改变图片：能见度、太阳能输出和健康状况仍遵循真实尘埃。下方预览沙尘暴以查看您的更改。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:932
msgid "Thickness"
msgstr "厚度"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: tooltip
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:934
msgid ""
"How thick the air gets for a given storm. Above 1 it closes in further than the measured visibility."
msgstr "给定风暴的空气厚度。高于 1 表示比测量能见度更浓密。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:935
msgid "Hides the sky"
msgstr "遮蔽天空"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: tooltip
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:936
msgid ""
"How much of the sky a full storm covers, sun, clouds and stars included. At 0 the dust stays a low layer with the sky clear above it."
msgstr "一次完全的风暴覆盖的天空比例，包括太阳、云和星星。为 0 时，尘埃保持低层，上方天空清晰。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:937
msgid "Layer height"
msgstr "层高"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: tooltip
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:939
msgid ""
"Scales how tall the dust layer stands: 30 m for light dust up to 350 m for a full storm at 1."
msgstr "计算尘埃层的高度：轻微尘埃为 30 m，完全风暴时为 350 m（当值为 1 时）。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:940
msgid "Wind streaks"
msgstr "风流痕迹"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: tooltip
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:941
msgid ""
"How strongly the dust streams in bands along the wind, with denser gusts sweeping downwind."
msgstr "风带沿风向的尘埃流强度，伴有更密集的阵风向顺风方向扫过。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:943
msgid "Reset look"
msgstr "重置外观"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:948
msgid "Preview a hazard"
msgstr "预览危害"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:951
msgid ""
"Forces a hazard on so you can watch it play out — this panel closes so you actually see it; the badge at the top of the screen shows what's running (click it to stop early). Ramps in and out like a real event. Works even with the simulation toggle off, changes no settings, and is never saved."
msgstr ""
"强制触发一个危害以便您观察其发展——此面板会关闭以便您真正看到它；屏幕顶部的徽章显示正在运行的内容（点击可提前停止）。像真实事件一样平稳进入和退出。即使模拟开关关闭也能工作，不更改任何设置，且永不保存。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:989
msgid "Severity"
msgstr "严重程度"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_settings_panel.gd:993
msgid ""
"Air-quality data: Copernicus Atmosphere Monitoring Service (CAMS) ENSEMBLE via Open-Meteo. Alert history: NOAA/NWS via Iowa Environmental Mesonet."
msgstr ""
"空气质量数据：通过 Open-Meteo 获取的 Copernicus Atmosphere Monitoring Service (CAMS) ENSEMBLE。警报历史记录：通过 Iowa Environmental Mesonet 获取的 NOAA/NWS。"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: label
#: scenes/ui/timeline_ui.gd:1080
msgid "Linked values"
msgstr "关联值"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#: scenes/ui/timeline_ui.gd:1228
msgid "held · {owner}"
msgstr "持有 · {owner}"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
# qa: 4 Jump to here
#. budget: button
#: scenes/ui/timeline_ui.gd:2016
msgid "Jump the playhead here"
msgstr "跳转到此处"

# machine: ollama/gemma4:latest 2026-11-22
#. budget: button
#: scenes/ui/timeline_ui.gd:2019
